<cell id="cell-12"><cell_type>markdown</cell_type>## Architecture (Mermaid)

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    E[Events:<br/>user_id, event_name, timestamp, properties] --> ES[EventStore]
    ES --> M[8 Metrics:<br/>SQL def + Python impl]
    M --> R[Report]
    R --> AB[A/B test:<br/>lift + p-value]
    R --> F[Funnel:<br/>drop-off per step]
    R --> D[Dashboard]
    E --> ET[ETL to warehouse]
    ET --> SQL[SQL metrics<br/>on Snowflake]
    SQL --> D
```

**Read as:** events flow into the EventStore; metrics are computed in Python (fast iteration on samples) and SQL (warehouse on full data); the report feeds the A/B test, the funnel, and the dashboard.</cell id="cell-12">
